[I] D-Bus API headers for the Mode Control Entity

[T] mce-dev contains the development headers defining the D-Bus method calls
[T] provided by the Mode Control Entity (MCE) of Maemo and Sailfish OS, and
[T] the signals emitted by it.

[U] https://github.com/sailfishos/mce-dev

